.TH ULAUNCHER "1" "August 2026" "Ulauncher 6.0.0-beta34" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ulauncher \- GTK 4 Adwaita launcher matching Spotlight-goshos
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ulauncher
[\fI\,COMMAND\/\fR] [\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
GoshLauncher is a GTK 4 + libadwaita launcher. Open with Ctrl+Space.
Search follows Spotlight-goshos (URLs, paths, folders, bookmarks, apps,
calculator, units, color, clock, windows, system actions, GNOME Settings,
recent files, then web). Seventeen looks with chrome. Prefixes: = calc,
@ web, # settings, $ windows, . recents, ! command (off by default).
.SH APP COMMANDS
.TP
start
Start the Ulauncher background process
.TP
show
Show the Ulauncher window (default command)
.TP
toggle
Toggle the Ulauncher window
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help
.SH EXTENSION COMMANDS
.TP
extensions (e)
List installed extensions
.TP
install (i)
Install an extension from URL
.TP
uninstall (rm)
Uninstall an extension
.TP
upgrade (up)
Upgrade extensions
.TP
preview (pr)
Preview extension
